$ unikraft instance --help

Manage Unikraft Cloud instances.

Usage:
  unikraft instances <command> [flags]

Resources:
  get, inspect, show
          Inspect a instance.
  wait
          Wait for instances to match a filter.
  list, ls
          List instances.
  delete, rm, remove
          Remove a instance.
  create, new
          Create an instance.
  run
          Create an instance and optionally follow its logs.
  edit
          Edit an instance.
  logs
          Fetch and display instance logs.
  start
          Start one or more instances.
  stop
          Stop one or more instances.
  suspend
          Suspend one or more instances.
  restart
          Restart one or more instances.
  tunnel, port-forward
          Forward a local port to an unexposed instance.
  history
          Show checkpoint history for an instance.
  shell, sh
          Open an interactive shell on a sandbox instance.
  exec
          Execute a command on a sandbox instance.
  copy, cp
          Copy a file to or from a sandbox instance.
  write
          Write a file to a sandbox instance.
  read
          Read a file from a sandbox instance.

Templates:
  template, templates
          Manage instance templates.

Checkpoints:
  checkpoint, checkpoints
          Manage instance checkpoints.

